WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:10.323
Cora, Mo, and Wanda swam to the cave.

2
00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:14.098
Cora opened the compass.

3
00:00:14.099 --> 00:00:20.267
The top shell showed a grown-up whale.

4
00:00:20.268 --> 00:00:23.899
"That must be Wanda's mom!" Cora said.

5
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:29.203
The red arrow began to spin.

6
00:00:29.204 --> 00:00:32.266
It shot out of the cave.

7
00:00:32.267 --> 00:00:36.413
"Follow that arrow!" Cora said.

8
00:00:36.414 --> 00:00:42.628
Cora, Mo, and Wanda followed the arrow.

9
00:00:42.629 --> 00:00:45.606
The water was dirty.

10
00:00:45.607 --> 00:00:52.890
There was lots of garbage.

11
00:00:52.891 --> 00:00:58.414
It was hard to see the arrow.

12
00:00:58.415 --> 00:01:02.520
"This is how I lost Mama," Wanda said.

13
00:01:02.521 --> 00:01:05.048
"It was so hard to see.

14
00:01:05.049 --> 00:01:09.157
Then I couldn't hear her call anymore."

15
00:01:09.158 --> 00:01:13.953
Mo frowned. "The boats are dirty and loud!"

16
00:01:13.954 --> 00:01:19.798
"I want my mama!" Wanda cried.

17
00:01:19.799 --> 00:01:23.538
"Don't worry." Cora patted Wanda.

18
00:01:23.539 --> 00:01:26.664
"The arrow will find her."

19
00:01:26.665 --> 00:01:31.418
"Um . . . ," Mo said. "Where is the arrow?

20
00:01:31.419 --> 00:01:45.254
I don't see it anymore."

21
00:01:45.255 --> 00:01:49.466
"The water is clean here," Wanda said.

22
00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:52.944
"But I don't see the arrow."

23
00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:55.496
"Me neither," Cora said.

24
00:01:55.497 --> 00:02:04.814
"I think we lost it!"

25
00:02:04.815 --> 00:02:11.012
They searched for the arrow.

26
00:02:11.013 --> 00:02:17.184
They swam closer to the boats.

27
00:02:17.185 --> 00:02:21.210
Suddenly a large net dropped into the water.

28
00:02:21.211 --> 00:02:29.428
"Swim away!" Cora yelled. "Fast!"

